    "teaserText": "Fighting with allies",
    "startText": "Anthony looked left and right. [concerned]Two poor recruits in light armour were facing heavily armoured opponents.\n\nHe considered helping. [opportunistic]After all, saving a man's hide was often the quickest way to get him to buy a round. Assuming he kept it, of course.",
